---
description: SvelteKit Capacitor SPA routing conventions
globs:
  - src/routes/**/*
alwaysApply: true
---

This project targets Capacitor deployment and should stay SPA-first.

- Prefer universal route modules: `+page.ts`, `+layout.ts`, and `+error.ts`.
- Prefer server variants (`+page.server.ts`, `+layout.server.ts`) only when strictly required for server-only concerns such as private secrets, secure credentials, or trusted backend-only operations.
- Keep default routing behavior compatible with SPA static hosting (`adapter-static` + fallback).
- If adding prerendering in SPA mode, use route-level options and pair `prerender = true` with `ssr = true` for that route.
